            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"part-3-strings-f-strings-20-min\">Part 3 \u2014 Strings &amp; f-strings (20 min)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You'll constantly need to build readable text from variables \u2014 for\nreports, print statements, or file names. An <strong>f-string</strong> (formatted\nstring) lets you embed variables directly inside text using curly\nbraces <code>{ }</code>, and even format numbers (e.g. <code>.1f</code> rounds to one\ndecimal).</span></span>"
