            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"part-4-lists-30-min\">Part 4 \u2014 Lists (30 min)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A <strong>list</strong> stores an ordered sequence of values. Perfect for a series\nof heart rate samples, session distances, or lap times.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Key facts:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Written with square brackets: <code>[10, 20, 30]</code></li>\n<li><strong>Indexed from 0</strong> \u2014 the first element is <code>my_list[0]</code></li>\n<li>Mutable \u2014 you can change, add, or remove elements after creation</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
