            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><ul>\n<li>Access a value: <code>athlete[\"sport\"]</code> \u2192 <code>cycling</code></li>\n<li>Add a new key: <code>athlete[\"ftp_watts\"] = 265</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Dictionary now looks like:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>{'name': 'Anna', 'age': 24, 'sport': 'cycling', 'resting_hr': 48, 'vo2max': 58.4, 'ftp_watts': 265}</code></span></span>"
