            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"part-6-conditionals-if-elif-else-30-min\">Part 6 \u2014 Conditionals: <code>if</code> / <code>elif</code> / <code>else</code> (30 min)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Conditionals let your code make decisions:</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">condition</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n<span class=\"k\">elif</span> <span class=\"n\">other_condition</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n<span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Comparison operators: <code>==</code>, <code>!=</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>\nLogical operators: <code>and</code>, <code>or</code>, <code>not</code></span></span>"
          }
