          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"part-7-loops-for-and-while-35-min\">Part 7 \u2014 Loops: <code>for</code> and <code>while</code> (35 min)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A <code>for</code> loop repeats an action <strong>once for each item</strong> in a sequence\n(like a list). A <code>while</code> loop repeats <strong>as long as a condition stays\ntrue</strong>, which is useful when you don't know the number of iterations\nin advance.</span></span>"
