            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Simulating training weeks until a target of <code>150.0</code> km is reached:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">After <code>4</code> week(s), cumulative distance is <code>193.0</code> km.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Notice the <code>while</code> loop needs <strong>two</strong> stopping conditions here\n(distance reached, <em>or</em> we run out of weeks) \u2014 always make sure a\n<code>while</code> loop can actually stop, or it will run forever.</span></span>"
