            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"break-15-min\">\u2615 Break (15 min)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Stretch, grab a coffee. When we're back: <strong>functions</strong> \u2014 the single\nmost useful concept for turning one-off code into reusable analysis\ntools.</span>\n<hr /></span>"
